WEBVTT

00:36:28.778 --> 00:36:30.076
to the people around you.

00:36:30.100 --> 00:36:31.405
JD: I love the idea

00:36:31.429 --> 00:36:35.571
that in every interaction
we have with other people,

00:36:35.595 --> 00:36:40.393
we can leave a trace
that makes that person better off.

00:36:40.417 --> 00:36:42.412
AG: Oh, that's such
a beautiful statement.

00:36:42.436 --> 00:36:43.948
JD: Yeah, it's magnificent.

00:36:43.972 --> 00:36:46.235
It's just ... and it's true!

00:36:46.259 --> 00:36:49.000
(Theme music)

00:36:52.290 --> 00:36:54.053
AG: Next time on WorkLife.

00:36:54.077 --> 00:36:57.727
Man: I used to interview
the same way everybody else did:

00:36:57.751 --> 00:37:01.331
two people sitting across a table
lying to each other for a couple hours.